00:24:09,664 --> 00:24:14,364
And I would like you to make up your mind as to what you think is more important.

323
00:24:14,664 --> 00:24:16,214
So, briefly, profiling in

324
00:24:16,214 --> 00:24:18,539
the beginning, when it was first

