00:24:24,264 --> 00:24:27,564
These were price, time and dispersion of trade.

328
00:24:28,164 --> 00:24:34,364
The original value area included the dispersion of trade over an area of prices known as the value area.

329
00:24:35,064 --> 00:24:39,164
This area shows where 70% of trade has been facilitated.

330
00:24:39,664 --> 00:24:42,664
This worked very well in the early days of the profiling tool.

331
00:24:43,064 --> 00:24:45,789
However, as volume became more important

