00:25:42,964 --> 00:25:50,364
The first one, most participants nowadays have converted to using only volume value areas and I'll explain to you why.

350
00:25:50,564 --> 00:25:57,964
First and foremost, using volume value area means we can incorporate all the different time zone sessions into our analysis.

351
00:25:58,564 --> 00:25:59,964
Now, what do I mean by that?

