00:26:51,864 --> 00:26:53,201
So using the volume

367
00:26:53,201 --> 00:26:55,207
instead of the traditional will sort

368
00:26:55,207 --> 00:26:57,213
of almost allow you to be

369
00:26:57,213 --> 00:26:58,550
able to use your

370
00:26:58,550 --> 00:27:01,225
charts 24 hours as opposed to just certain sessions.

371
00:27:02,064 --> 00:27:06,364
The next benefit, volume shows actual intention of buyers and sellers.

372
00:27:07,064 --> 00:27:13,364
As change occurs with price moving, buyers or sellers need to react with volume, hence showing their intent.

373
00:27:13,364 --> 00:27:18,764
In other words, we can use volume as a key gauge for the intention of buyers or sellers.

