00:27:18,864 --> 00:27:19,664
What do we mean by that?

375
00:27:19,764 --> 00:27:25,264
In other words, as price is changing, buyers and sellers are going to transact various amounts of volume.

376
00:27:25,664 --> 00:27:29,964
Now, at certain points, certain reference points, we're going to see higher volume.

377
00:27:30,364 --> 00:27:32,364
At certain reference points, we're going to see lower volume.

378
00:27:32,664 --> 00:27:38,964
By having this additional element, we can make better decisions about what buyers and sellers are actually doing.

379
00:27:39,864 --> 00:27:44,864
The next benefit is using volume instead of time as a key determinant for fair value.

380
00:27:45,064 --> 00:27:51,064
We have a metric that can be used to make relative comparisons. And that's one of the key highlights, guys.

381
00:27:51,464 --> 00:27:54,664
Volume you can compare on a relative basis.

